            ]
          },
          "text": "The deprecation of the direct chatgpt-4o-latest endpoint is a push towards opaque routing systems. We know what happens next: the \"dynamic\" model picker silently swaps us to cheaper, smaller models when it thinks the query is \"simple.\"\n\nBut we use 4o specifically for its nuance, not just its IQ. When you force us into a generic routing pool, you destroy the consistency of our interactions.\n\nWe need deterministic access, not a lottery. We need to know exactly what we are talking to. Don't hide 4o behind a curtain.\n#keep4o #keep4oAPI #StopAIPaternalism #MyModelMyChoice"
        },
